oss":"Invincible (Marathi form)."},{"iast":"satyanārāyaṇa","name":"Satyanarayana","devanagari":"सत्यनारायण","dictionary_gloss":"Narayana who is truth; a form of Vishnu worshipped in the Satyanarayana vrata."},{"iast":"rāmakṛṣṇa","name":"Ramakrishna","devanagari":"रामकृष्ण","dictionary_gloss":"Rama and Krishna together; the 19th-century saint Sri Ramakrishna."},{"iast":"mallikārjuna","name":"Mallikarjuna","devanagari":"मल्लिकार्जुन","dictionary_gloss":"Shiva of Srisailam, white as jasmine."},{"iast":"vīrabhadra","name":"Veerabhadra","devanagari":"वीरभद्र","dictionary_gloss":"Auspicious hero; a fierce form of Shiva."},{"iast":"sāmbaśiva","name":"Sambasiva","devanagari":"साम्बशिव","dictionary_gloss":"Shiva together with Amba (Parvati)."},{"iast":"cirañjīvī","name":"Chiranjeevi","devanagari":"चिरंजीवी","dictionary_gloss":"Immortal, long-lived."},{"iast":"śivarāja","name":"Shivaraj","devanagari":"शिवराज","dictionary_gloss":"King Shiva; royal Shiva."},{"iast":"yaśavanta","name":"Yashwant","devanagari":"यशवन्त","dictionary_gloss":"Famous, glorious."},{"iast":"anūpa","name":"Anoop","devanagari":"अनूप","dictionary_gloss":"Incomparable, unmatched."},{"iast":"śrījit","name":"Sreejith","devanagari":"श्रीजित्","dictionary_gloss":"Winner of prosperity."},{"iast":"sajīva","name":"Sajeev","devanagari":"सजीव","dictionary_gloss":"Full of life, lively."},{"iast":"rājīva","name":"Rajeev","devanagari":"राजीव","dictionary_gloss":"Blue lotus."},{"iast":"sañjīva","name":"Sanjeev","devanagari":"संजीव","dictionary_gloss":"Life-giving, reviving."},{"iast":"nayana","name":"Nayan","devanagari":"नयन","dictionary_gloss":"Eye; a guide."},{"iast":"vihāna","name":"Vihaan","devanagari":"विहान","dictionary_gloss":"Dawn, morning (modern popular name; etymology uncertain)."},{"iast":"ayaṃśa","name":"Ayansh","devanagari":"अयांश","dictionary_gloss":"Modern name; etymology uncertain (popularly explained as 'part of the divine' or 'ray of light')."},{"iast":"kṛṣ","name":"Krish","devanagari":"कृष्","dictiona